  "trainer/30846.htm": {
   "file": "trainer/30846.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Blacksmith Wilbert: Haha! Blacksmiths make armor, swords, polearms, axes, plows... But don't you start thinking we stop there! Over there, Aden Castle stands, proudly disregarding the laws of gravity. And you know why? Engineering! It would have collapsed a long time ago if it hadn't been for the e…",
   "header": "Blacksmith Wilbert",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Craft a dualsword",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Link common/duals_03.htm",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "common/duals_03.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Bestow special ability on a weapon",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Link common/weapon_sa_01.htm",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "common/weapon_sa_01.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Craft an item",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Link common/crafting_01.htm",
