    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers/30846-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers/30846-05.html",
   "quest": 663,
   "text": "Wilbert: Ha ha! Think you have what it takes to be a winner? Yes? How about the two of us play a round or two? Tell you what, we can even practice a little first if you prefer. Of course, even a practice run isn't free -- after all, why play at all if there isn't something at stake? But I'll make t…",
   "header": "Wilbert",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; has items 8766; qs.getMemoState() < 4; qs.getMemoState() >= 1"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I want to practice.\" (Requires 1 Spirit Bead)",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00663_SeductiveWhispers 30846-22.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers",
     "event": "30846-22.html",
