   "file": "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers/30846-04.html",
   "quest": 663,
   "text": "Wilbert: You know that you need a Spirit Bead to play the game, right? Now, why don't you go get some so we can get started? Go to the National Cemetery, the Ancient Battlegrounds and the Fields of Massacre and get some Spirit Beads from the undead and the demons.",
