   "file": "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers/30846-01a.htm",
   "quest": 663,
   "text": "Wilbert: From time to time, we enjoy a duel game called The Battle of Sun and Moon . It's pretty popular in these parts, in case you haven't heard of it. I've found it a great way to pass the time when you're between jobs. Just say the word and I'll teach you everything you need to know. What do yo…",
   "header": "Wilbert",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I'd like to play.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00663_SeductiveWhispers 30846-03.htm",
