   "file": "Q00663_SeductiveWhispers/30846-03.htm",
   "quest": 663,
   "text": "Wilbert: All right! If that's what you want, I'll let you you join in. You can't be ready for the game already, can you? You're not thinking of joining in without bringing anything to the table, are you? You have to go get one item if you want to enjoy a game with us. It's not so hard to find, but …",
   "header": "Wilbert",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"What is a Spirit Bead?\"",
